stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> RUNNING: process_video returns request_id
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: poll returns RUNNING or UNKNOWN
    RUNNING --> AuthRequired: authentication required
    AuthRequired --> RUNNING: OAuth completes and app reruns
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: poll returns COMPLETED
    RUNNING --> FAILED: poll or Adversal error
    COMPLETED --> Workspace: open saved artifacts
    Workspace --> COMPLETED: resume same job later
    FAILED --> [*]: start over

    note right of RUNNING
        Persisted in runs/jobs.json
        Polled every 8 seconds
    end note
    note right of COMPLETED
        notes.md and frames remain durable
        Qdrant can be rebuilt or reused
    end note
